@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #F7F9FC
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #4765A1
  LifeLineBorderColor #B4C2DB
  ParticipantBorderColor #A6B5C7
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
}
title Pagamento recusado: liberar e cancelar
autonumber
actor "Cliente" as C
participant "Order Service" as O
queue "RabbitMQ" as B
participant "Saga Orchestrator" as S
participant "Inventory Service" as I
participant "Payment Service" as P
participant "Gateway Financeiro" as G

legend bottom
  Setas assíncronas passam pelo RabbitMQ.
  HTTP do cliente e HTTPS com o gateway são síncronos.
endlegend

C -> O: POST /orders
O --> C: 202 Accepted / PENDING
O ->> B: OrderCreated (Outbox)
B ->> S: OrderCreated
S ->> B: ReserveStock
B ->> I: ReserveStock
I ->> B: StockReserved(HELD)
B ->> S: StockReserved
S ->> B: ChargePayment
B ->> P: ChargePayment
P -> G: Cobrar via HTTPS, chave idempotente
G --> P: DECLINED final, nenhum débito
P ->> B: PaymentDeclined
B ->> S: PaymentDeclined (WAITING_RELEASE)
S ->> B: ReleaseStock(reservationId)
B ->> I: ReleaseStock
I ->> B: StockReleased(RELEASED)
B ->> S: StockReleased
S ->> B: CancelOrder
B ->> O: CancelOrder
O ->> B: OrderCancelled(CANCELLED)
B ->> S: OrderCancelled (COMPENSATED)

@enduml
